       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Total daily dose:** 1700 mg three times daily is 5,100 mg/day. The labeled maximum for metformin is 2,550 mg/day (2,000 mg/day for extended-release).\n- **Single dose:** 1700 mg is well above the usual maximum of about 1,000 mg per dose. A dose that high raises the risk of lactic acidosis and GI toxicity.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **500 mg** three times daily with meals (1,500 mg/day)\n- **850 mg** three times daily with meals (2,550 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **1,700 mg/day** total, for example 850 mg twice daily\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1700 mg three times daily, please confirm that explicitly. I'd suggest adding a note with your rationale to the order."
